  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Created as a means to clean up battlefields, as the very nature of such a cleanup in a multi-species Republic is complex due to the variety of ailments that are capable of cross-species infection.",
    "value": "最初作为多物种共和国的战场清理工具被研发，因跨物种疾病频发的环境使传统清理手段失效。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The virus was once a simple organism, but mutated and gained sentience. At this point it becomes an aggressive prion capable of quantum relocation across dimensional wavelengths through sheer luck. Infecting people, it becomes known as GREG-771",
    "value": "该病毒本为简单生物体，经变异后获得知觉，转化为具有攻击性的朊病毒。其通过纯概率性量子重定位跨越维度波长，因感染特征被称为格雷格-771。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Mutating further, it gets loose. Upon its final mutation it begins to breed sentient parasites. These infect a host corpse, and latch onto its cerebellum as they mature. Once reaching maturty, the Parasite enters a pupae stage and forms a cocoon within the corpse.",
    "value": "进一步变异导致失控。最终突变体开始繁殖有知觉的寄生虫：这些个体感染宿主尸体，成熟时附着于小脑。完全成熟后，寄生虫进入蛹期，在尸体内形成茧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "It devours the corpse during this transition, leaving behind a slimey outline matching that of the original host. Once this host corpse is digested, the Symbiote is birthed from the slime sack as a fully mature slime.",
    "value": "破茧过程中，它吞噬尸体，仅残留与原宿主轮廓一致的黏液空壳。消化完成后，共生体以成熟黏液形态从黏液囊中诞生。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "These are immediately taken in by elder variants who teach them of their new lives and civilization, as their brains are fresh and new. They are fully capable of adult human reflexes from birth.",
    "value": "这些新生个体具备成人反射能力，但大脑全新。年长变种会立即接纳并传授新文明知识。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "These new beings are in no way related to the original prion infection. They are not invaders...they simply are born from misery. The poor dears.",
    "value": "它们与原始朊病毒感染无关，并非入侵者...只是从苦难中诞生的存在。可怜的生物们。"
  }
